                "topic": "Section I: Part A (No Calculator)",
                "difficulty": "medium",
                "question": "<p>The number of bacteria in a petri dish increases at a rate of <em>R</em>(<em>t</em>) bacteria per hour. If there are 1,000 bacteria at time <em>t</em> = 5, which of the following expressions gives the total number of bacteria in the petri dish at <em>t</em> = 7 ?</p>",
