                "topic": "Section I: Part A (No Calculator)",
                "difficulty": "medium",
                "question": "<p>The graph of <em>y</em> = <em>x</em><sup>4</sup> – 3<em>x</em><sup>3</sup> – 60<em>x</em><sup>2</sup> + 24<em>x</em> – 36 is concave up for</p>",
