                "topic": "Section I: Part A (No Calculator)",
                "difficulty": "medium",
                "question": "<p>If the geometric series\r                             <img src=\"images/e0b82fc3db7a4a5bae6c08cbc9f74776.png\" class=\"exam-img\" style=\"max-width:100%; vertical-align:middle; margin:4px 0;\">\r                             converges, what is its sum?</p>",
