                "difficulty": "hard",
                "question": "<p>What is the area of the region in the first quadrant enclosed by the graphs of <em>y</em> = sin <em>x</em>, <em>y </em>= –<em>x</em> + 3, and the <em>y</em>-axis?</p>",
