                "difficulty": "hard",
                "question": "<p>A particle moves along the <em>x</em>-axis so that at any given time <em>t</em> ≥ 0, its velocity is given by\r                                 <img src=\"images/a2defe1d48fa425199900d028be3acb6.png\" class=\"exam-img\" style=\"max-width:100%; vertical-align:middle; margin:4px 0;\">. What is the acceleration of the particle at <em>t</em> = 5 ?</p>",
